        "created_at": "2015-04-17T02:10:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can't find it now, but there was a post on one of the many forums this community uses, (Steam, Handelabra, and this one. Twitter too I think)&nbsp; Where a Dev mentioned they're accepting ideas for conditions for future unlocks as more heroes are released.</p><p>Was that serious? And if so, How would you prefer those ideas to come through? PM? E-mail? Random Forum posts? (Probably not the last, because then people would just go through a thread and try them all one by one.)</p>",
