        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-17T02:19:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>And if this is indeed the case</p><p>what restrictions should we put in place</p><p>on hoops to jump through</p><p>and things we can do</p><p>without creating disgrace</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What I'm trying to ask is what kinds of unlock conditions are good, and which ones are bad? &nbsp;For example, so far all unlocks have been possible through reasonable play (i.e. the Expat promo wasn't reached by having Fixer punch her in the face. &nbsp;That's not something that would ever come up in a game, unless you were specifically trying to unlock a promo). &nbsp;Is that always going to be a criteria? &nbsp;Are there any others?</p>",
