        "id": 140169,
        "name": "Natediggadoggity",
        "username": "Natediggadoggity",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/f04885/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-17T05:47:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Okay, well I'll end this with speculation for when the future variants might arrive.</p><p>The next expansion has Nightmist and the Argent Adept, with Akash'Buta, Gloomweaver, Apostate, and the Ennead. If any hero variant needs money to unlock, I bet it will be Kvothe-Six string, which would send more proceeds to Heifer International, which I wouldn't mind seeing. Apostate has a great chance for Fanatic's first variant, with Redeem. Skinwalker Gloomweaver, and Agent of Gloom Spite might come up as well, and that goes well with Dark Visionary. Dark Watch Nightmist is a possibility, Ra: Horus of 2 Horizons could come up with the Ennead around, but so far that's 7 variants, which is a lot, and a couple might be saved for Mini Expansion 2.</p><p>Most likely in that one, is Eternal Haka with Final Wasteland. Scholar of the Infinite is possible, but I don't think it's very likely.</p><p>Shattered timelines will probably have all Freedom Six (I hope) and maybe even Chrono-Ranger: The Best of Times, but that's another 7 unlocks, which might be pushing it.</p><p>Wrath of the Cosmos has the 5 Prime Wardens, which is a fair amount.</p><p>For Mini Expansion 3... we don't have Promos made for Omnitron X, Skyscraper, or Guise. Might they be out by then?</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:17:01.710Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
