        "raw": "<p>Okay, well I&#39;ll end this with speculation for when the future variants might arrive.</p><p>The next expansion has Nightmist and the Argent Adept, with Akash&#39;Buta, Gloomweaver, Apostate, and the Ennead. If any hero variant needs money to unlock, I bet it will be Kvothe-Six string, which would send more proceeds to Heifer International, which I wouldn&#39;t mind seeing. Apostate has a great chance for Fanatic&#39;s first variant, with Redeem. Skinwalker Gloomweaver, and Agent of Gloom Spite might come up as well, and that goes well with Dark Visionary. Dark Watch Nightmist is a possibility, Ra: Horus of 2 Horizons could come up with the Ennead around, but so far that&#39;s 7 variants, which is a lot, and a couple might be saved for Mini Expansion 2.</p><p>Most likely in that one, is Eternal Haka with Final Wasteland. Scholar of the Infinite is possible, but I don&#39;t think it&#39;s very likely.</p><p>Shattered timelines will probably have all Freedom Six (I hope) and maybe even Chrono-Ranger: The Best of Times, but that&#39;s another 7 unlocks, which might be pushing it.</p><p>Wrath of the Cosmos has the 5 Prime Wardens, which is a fair amount.</p><p>For Mini Expansion 3... we don&#39;t have Promos made for Omnitron X, Skyscraper, or Guise. Might they be out by then?</p>",
